His Excellency CHHEANG Thyra presents the Letter of Credence to the President of Hungary
His Excellency CHHEANG Thyra, Ambassador-designate of the Kingdom of Cambodia to Hungary with Residence in Berlin, Germany, presented the Letter of Credence appointing him as Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary to Hungary to His Excellency Dr
His Excellency Ambassador conveyed the most cordial greetings and best wishes of His Majesty Preah Bat Samdech Preah Boromneath NORODOM Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, to His Excellency President of Hungary
Ambassador Thyra commenced by congratulating Hungary on assuming the EU presidency for the second half of 2024 as well as celebrating its 20th anniversary as a member of the European Union
