The Royal Embassy of Cambodia to the Federal Republic of Germany organized the 57th ASEAN Day Celebration
Attending the event were His Excellency Ambassador Frank Hartmann, Director General in charge of Asia and Pacific Affairs of the Federal Foreign Office; representatives from the Federal Ministry for Economic Cooperation and Development; ambassadors of ASEAN Dialogue Partners; ambassadors and diplomats from ASEAN countries; and desk officers of the Federal Foreign Office in charge of ASEAN countries, totaling approximately 150 attendees
As the rotating Chair of the Berlin ASEAN Committee, His Excellency CHHEANG Thyra delivered ASEAN Day message, highlighting the remarkable achievements of ASEAN
His excellency ambassador also underscored the importance of continued collaboration among member states and partners to maintain and build upon these successes
The celebration featured a special segment showcasing video clips from ASEAN member states, highlighting their unique tourist attractions and rich cultural heritage
