During the visit, the ALC delegation paid a courtesy call on the Honourable John Swinney, First Minister of Scotland, and His Excellency Graeme Dey, Minister for Higher and Further Education and Minister for Veterans
Both sides engaged in productive discussions on enhancing cooperation in key areas such as higher education, renewable energy, and trade and investment
