Suon Sophal, Deputy Secretary General of the Cambodia Investment Board, to discuss the latest developments of investment potential and investment environment in Cambodia
His Excellency Tan Bunpa meets with Neak Oknha Lim Heng, Vice President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce
