Presenting credentials to His Majesty King Charles III
On 6 February 2025, in London, Her Excellency TUOT Panha presented her credentials to His Majesty King Charles III at Buckingham Palace, accrediting her as the Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary of the Kingdom of Cambodia to the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland
During the royal audience, Her Excellency the Ambassador conveyed to His Majesty King Charles III the compliments and best wishes from His Majesty the King of Cambodia
Her Excellency the Ambassador briefed His Majesty the King on the continued development of Cambodia-UK relations across various fields, including politics, defense, trade and investment, education, and tourism
His Majesty expressed his delight at the growing relations and the rapid development in Cambodia
