During the royal audience, Her Excellency conveyed the compliments and best wishes of His Majesty the King of Cambodia to His Majesty King Carl XVI Gustaf
Prior to the royal audience, Her Excellency was warmly received by Her Excellency Maria Christina Lundqvist, Chief of Protocol, and His Excellency Robert Rydberg, Marshal of the Diplomatic Corps
The Royal Embassy of Cambodia in Canberra participates in the National Multicultural Festival
