The Ambassador stressed on Cambodia’s openness for foreign investments, the impressive development in the bilateral trade exchanges, the recent visit to Cambodia by a delegation of 15 main American companies and the shared commitment of the Cambodian Government and the US businessmen to further enhance business and investment cooperation, the development by which the congressman was impressed
