An Inter-ministerial and Private Sector Meeting on the Progress of the Implementation of Economic Diplomacy Strategy 2021-2023 (09 December 2021)
Under the guidance of His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister PRAK Sokhonn, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, on 09 December 2021, a virtual meeting among the inter-ministerial and the private sector working group had been hosted to report and monitor the 2021 progress of the implementation of Economic Diplomacy Strategy (2021-2023) and the way forward for the 2022 Action Plan
Members of the working group, who were representatives from relevant ministries and institutions such as Cambodia missions abroad, the Ministry of Economy and Finance, the Ministry of Commerce, the Ministry of Tourism, the Cambodia Chamber of Commerce, and from the private sector, gave presentations to share information and their experiences in hope to strengthen cooperation and contribute to the effective implementation of economic diplomacy towards further socio-economic development
