His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister and Her Excellency Roueida El Hage expressed the appreciation of more than three decades of cooperation between the Royal Government of Cambodia and OHCHR in Cambodia, which underscores the former’s stance on good cooperation with the United Nations mechanisms
During the meeting, His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister spoke highly of the Royal Government of Cambodia’s strong commitment in promoting and protecting human rights in Cambodia, as well as enhancing the International Cooperation on human rights through the ratification and adoption of the eight International Conventions of the nine International Conventions related to Human Rights
