Both deputy foreign ministers also touched on the ASEAN-Brazil relations, where Ambassador Eduardo Paes Saboia renewed Brazil’s appreciation for Cambodia’s support for Brazil to become ASEAN’s Sectoral Dialogue Partner in 2022 during Cambodia’s ASEAN Chairmanship
His Excellency CHUM Sounry encouraged Brazil, as an important member of MERCOSUR, to move forward the ASEAN-MERCOSUR free trade arrangements for the interests of the two regions
