They highlighted Cambodia’s enriching history of women's engagement in society, underscoring the country's ongoing efforts to build on this legacy
The discussion also encompassed Cambodia's active participation in UN peacekeeping operations and the active role in assisting in humanitarian activities under the UN framework
Welcome the official visit of His Excellency Maris SANGIAMPONGSA, Minister of Foreign Affairs of the Kingdom of Thailand, to the Kingdom of Cambodia!
