His Excellency CHUM Sounry received farewell call by Ambassador of Kuwait upon his Completion of Tenure in Cambodia
On 06 August 2024, His Excellency CHUM Sounry, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, received a farewell call by His Excellency Mohamad Saeed Shafi Al-Hajri, Ambassador of the State of Kuwait to Cambodia
Secretary of State CHUM Sounry appreciated the contribution made by Ambassador Mohamad Saeed Shafi Al-Hajri in the enhancement of the relationship and cooperation between Cambodia and Kuwait
The Secretary of State and the Ambassador expressed their satisfaction with the development in the cooperation in the bilateral and multilateral frameworks since the establishment of the diplomatic relations in 1994
They also discussed the possibility to hold the next session of bilateral consultations between the two Ministries of Foreign Affairs next year to explore ways and means to further broaden the cooperation between the two countries
