Her Excellency Secretary of State Khiev Sophany stressed, “Accounts play a vital role in supporting diplomatic mission’s operation and promoting national interest.”
On 27 August 2024, Her Excellency Secretary of State Khiev Sophany, on behalf of His Excellency SOK Chenda Sophea, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, presided over a Closing Ceremony of the Training Course on “Accounting for Diplomatic Missions” at the National Institute of Diplomacy and International Relations, for 21 accountants who have been assigned to the Cambodia diplomatic missions abroad
Addressing at the session, Her Excellency Secretary of State underscored the vital role of accountants in supporting daily operations of the diplomatic missions
Her Excellency also instructed all trainees to perform their assigned duties and responsibilities professionally and collaboratively to promote the national interest
