His Excellency KHUON Phon Rattanak expressed deep gratitude for Liechtenstein's commitment to enhancing educational cooperation with Cambodia, which is closely aligned with the priorities of the Royal Government of Cambodia
His Excellency SOK Chenda Sophea has taken part in the inauguration of the “Francophonie Village”
Ahead of the participation of His Majesty Preah Bat Samdech Preah Boromneath NORODOM Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, in the Nineteenth Francophonie Summit in France from 4 to 5 October, His Excellency SOK Chenda Sophea, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, has taken part in the inauguration of the the “Francophonie Village” at Centquatre-Paris
At the Cambodian booth, His Excellency the Deputy Prime Minister warmly received Her Excellency Louise Mushikiwabo, the OIC Secretary General, and His Excellency Thani Mohamed Soilihi, Secretary of State for Francophonie and International Partnerships at the French Ministry for Europe and Foreign Affairs
