During the cordial meeting, His Excellency PHEN Savny expressed Cambodia’s appreciation for the long-standing friendship and fruitful cooperation between Cambodia and Bulgaria
Both sides discussed further deepening and strengthening bilateral cooperation between the two countries, especially in trade, tourism, culture and education
They also exchanged views on multilateral cooperation
