His Excellency the Secretary of State and His Excellency the Ambassador each delivered brief remarks, expressing their strong support for organizing friendly sporting events between the Ministry, the Malaysian Embassy and the Malaysian community in Cambodia
They underscored the importance of such initiatives in strengthening friendship, solidarity, and sports diplomacy, while also promoting bilateral cooperation, community engagement, and people-to-people ties between Cambodians and the Malaysian community in Cambodia
Meeting of the Executive Committee of the Southeast Asia Nuclear Weapon-Free Zone Commission
