His Excellency CHUM Sounry hosts a farewell lunch for outgoing Ambassador of Canada to Cambodia
His Excellency CHUM Sounry, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia, praised Her Excellency Ping Kitnikone, Ambassador of Canada to Cambodia, for her valuable contribution to advancing Cambodia-Canada relations, including the upgrade of the Office of the Embassy of Canada in Phnom Penh to a full-fledged Embassy
His Excellency Sounry also commended the Ambassador’s notable achievements during her tenure, as expressed during her farewell meeting held over a working lunch hosted by the Secretary on 25 July 2025
