Sardar Umar Alam, Acting UN Resident Coordinator, and Mr
Bryan Fornari, Head of Cooperation at the European Delegation to Cambodia, on 15 August 2025 at MFAIC
During the meeting, His Excellency the Secretary of State briefed them on the situation at the Cambodian-Thai border following the ceasefire agreement
