On the evening of the same day, His Excellency PRAK Sokhonn, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, participated in the Gala Dinner, hosted by His Excellency WANG Yi, Minister of Foreign Affairs of the People’s Republic of China in Anning City, Yunnan Province, China
