His Excellency Dr. Khy Sovannrattana meets with 35 Cambodian students
On 29 August 2025, His Excellency Sun Sovanna, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, and National Correspondent of Cambodia to the International Organisation of La Francophonie (OIF), held a working meeting with His Excellency Anouparb Vongnorkeo, Vice Minister of Foreign Affairs of the Lao People’s Democratic Republic, in charge of International Organisations, at the Ministry’s headquarters in Vientiane
The discussions mainly focused on the progress of preparations for the 20th Summit of La Francophonie, to be held in Cambodia, as well as on the designation of the next country to assume the presidency of the Network of Structures and Institutions in charge of La Francophonie in Asia-Pacific (RESIFAP)
The meeting also provided an opportunity to share experiences from the organisation of the 23rd Ministerial Conference of La Francophonie held in 2007
On this occasion, the Cambodian side invited the Lao People’s Democratic Republic to actively prepare for its participation in the Francophonie Summit and related events scheduled for 2026
