Royal Prayer Ceremony for the Prosperity of the Kingdom of Cambodia
On the morning of 31 October 2025, His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister PRAK Sokhonn, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, accompanied Her Majesty NORODOM Monineath Sihanouk, the Queen-Mother, High Representative of His Majesty Preah Bat Samdech Preah Boromneath Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, in the Royal Prayer Ceremony for the Prosperity of the Kingdom of Cambodia, at the Royal Palace
