His Excellency Dr. UN Kheang receives His Excellency Jonathan KINGS, Ambassador of New Zealand to Cambodia
Both sides also discussed ways to establish regular political consultations between the two countries' foreign ministries to further strengthen cooperation and mutual understanding between the two countries
His Excellency the Ambassador reaffirmed New Zealand’s support for the recent Joint Declaration between Thailand and Cambodia, which was signed in Malaysia under the witness of His Excellency Donald J
His Excellency KUNG Phoak has a bilateral meeting with Mr. NAGASE Kensuke, Minister and Deputy Chief of Mission of the Embassy of Japan to Cambodia
