Her Excellency EAT Sophea briefs on the recent outbreak of armed offensive along the Cambodia-Thai border to the Diplomatic Corps and international organizations
On the morning of 9 December 2025, at the Ministry, Her Excellency EAT Sophea, Permanent Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, conducted a briefing on the recent outbreak of armed offensive along the Cambodia-Thai border to member of diplomatic corps and international organizations accredited to Cambodia
Heads of Cambodian Missions overseas, and ASEAN Observer Team (AOT) also attended the briefing online
The Permanent Secretary of State apprised the participants of the chain of events leading up to Thailand's offensive against Cambodia, starting from the afternoon of 7 December 2025
She emphasized Cambodia’s deep appreciation for the presence of the Interim Observer Team (IOT) and the AOT in verifying Cambodia’s sincerity and commitment to the Kuala Lumpur Joint Declaration
She expressed gratitude to all friends for expressing support for the peaceful settlement of disputes and called for full respect for the ceasefire and the Kuala Lumpur Joint Declaration
