Marie-Josée AUDET, Assistant Deputy Minister for International Relations and La Francophonie of the Government of Quebec; Professor Slim KHALBOUS, Rector of the Agence Universitaire de la Francophonie (AUF); as well as senior officials from McGill University and HEC Montréal
