Bilateral discussion between Foreign Ministers of Cambodia and Singapore
On the morning of 22 December 2025, His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister PRAK Sokhonn, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, held a bilateral discussion with His Excellency Vivian Balakrishnan, Minister of Foreign Affairs of Singapore on the margins of the Special ASEAN Foreign Ministers’ Meeting on the current situation between Cambodia and Thailand, in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia
Both Foreign Ministers underscored the value of their continued engagement following their recent Meeting in New York last September
In relation to this conflict, His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister also took the opportunity to brief H
Vivian Balakrishnan on the latest situation, emphasizing the urgent need for an immediate ceasefire and calling for a diplomatic negotiations and constructive dialogue to ensure a lasting peace for the people of both nations
