His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister PRAK Sokhonn meets with Secretary-General of ASEAN, Dr. KAO Kim Hourn
Before returning back to the Kingdom of Cambodia, His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister PRAK Sokhonn, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, held a Meeting with His Excellency Dr
His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister expressed concern over the worsening humanitarian situation affecting nearly half a million displaced Cambodians and emphasized Cambodia’s strong commitment to promoting shared peace, security, and prosperity in the region, in accordance with the ASEAN Charter and the fundamental principles of international law, guided by a spirit of constructive engagement with all ASEAN Member States and partners
Special ASEAN Foreign Ministers’ Meeting on the Current Situation Between Cambodia and Thailand
