During the meeting, His Excellency Bong Sovath warmly welcomed and congratulated His Excellency Flavio Bonetti on his appointment
He underlined the Royal Government of Cambodia’s appreciation for UNESCO’s valuable contributions to advancing Cambodia’s development priorities, particularly in the fields of education, culture, and heritage preservation
His Excellency the Under Secretary of State and His Excellency Flavio Bonetti discussed four priority areas: (1) education for children from displaced families; (2) the celebration of the 75th anniversary of Cambodia’s membership in UNESCO; (3) the preservation and safeguarding of Cambodia’s cultural and World Heritage; and (4) the exploration of possible funding sources to support the Living Human Treasures Programme in Cambodia
