His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister PRAK Sokhonn holds a bilateral meeting with His Excellency Jean-Noël BARROT, Minister of Europe and Foreign Affairs of the Republic of France
On 25 February 2026, His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister PRAK Sokhonn, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, held a bilateral meeting with His Excellency Jean-Noël BARROT, Minister of Europe and Foreign Affairs of the Republic of France, in Paris, France
The two Foreign Ministers exchanged greetings and best wishes, following their most recent engagement via telephone in December 2025
His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister reaffirmed Cambodia's readiness to extend warm hospitality and to host the upcoming Francophonie Summit in 2026
Her Excellency CHRING Botum Rangsay chairs a hybrid meeting on strengthening agricultural and trade cooperation between Cambodia and China
On the afternoon of 24 February 2026, Her Excellency CHRING Botum Rangsay, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation (MFAIC), chaired a hybrid meeting on strengthening agricultural and trade cooperation between Cambodia and China, in furtherance of Economic Diplomacy efforts
Members of MFAIC's Economic Diplomacy Coordinating Group, representatives from the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, the Commerce Attaché of the General Consulate of Cambodia in Shanghai, and the Young Entrepreneurs Association of Cambodia (YEAC) attended the meeting
Discussions focused on the 25th International Agricultural Expo in Jiangsu Province, China, including coordination efforts and opportunities to promote Cambodian agricultural products and support the participation of Cambodian private sector companies
