His Excellency KHUON Phon Rattanak has a meeting with Ambassador of Netherlands to Cambodia
On the morning of 27 May 2025, His Excellency KHUON Phon Rattanak, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, had a meeting with His Excellency Remco van Wijngaarden, Ambassador of the Kingdom of the Netherlands to Cambodia, with residence in Bangkok, at the Ministry
During the meeting, both sides emphasized the increasing trend of bilateral trade between Cambodia and the Netherlands and the number of Dutch tourists visiting Cambodia, which showcased excellent and growing cooperation between the two countries
Both sides also shared views on regional and international issues of common interest and concern
